<li><strong>存储</strong>:从 $0.12/GiB-月</li>
<li><strong>备份</strong>:从 $0.0264/GiB-月</li>
<li><strong>数据传输</strong>:促销期免费</li>
<li>仅 2 个云区域(AWS)</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Premium 预付($400/月起)</h3>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 my-4 space-y-1">
<li>包含 Flex 全部特性</li>
<li>45 天备份保留</li>
<li>启用 SSO / SAML</li>
<li>启用指标端点</li>
<li>99.9% SLA + 4 小时 Severity 1 响应</li>
<li>电话 + Slack 支持</li>
<li>讲师带教 Jumpstart 培训</li>
<li><strong>向量维度</strong>:从 $0.003875/百万(比 Flex 单价更便宜)</li>
<li><strong>存储</strong>:从 $0.10/GiB-月</li>
<li><strong>备份</strong>:从 $0.0042/GiB-月</li>
<li>7 个云区域(GCP + AWS)</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Dedicated 合同制($400/月起)</h3>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 my-4 space-y-1">
<li>客户主导的集群升级</li>
<li>HIPAA 合规(AWS Dedicated)</li>
<li>启用 PrivateLink (AWS)</li>
<li>客户密钥加密卷</li>
<li>灵活备份保留期</li>
<li>自带 IdP(即将推出)</li>
<li>99.95% SLA + 1 小时 Severity 1 响应</li>
<li>Technical Account Team(可选)</li>
<li><strong>向量维度</strong>:从 $0.002718/百万(单价最低)</li>
<li><strong>存储</strong>:从 $0.1505/GiB-月(单价最高)</li>
<li><strong>备份</strong>:从 $0.0063/GiB-月</li>
<li>全部 ~40 个云区域(AWS、GCP、Azure)</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Embedding 服务定价</h3>
<table class="min-w-full my-4 border border-gray-200">
<thead class="bg-gray-50">
<tr><th class="px-4 py-2 text-left">模型</th><th class="px-4 py-2 text-left">百万 Token 单价</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">Snowflake Arctic-embed-m-v1.5</td><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">$0.025</td></tr>
<tr><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">Snowflake Arctic-embed-m-v2.0</td><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">$0.040</td></tr>
<tr><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">ColModernVBERT</td><td class="px-4 py-2 border-t">$0.065</td></tr>
